<Article title="Privacy Policy" description="How Embedded Engineering Toolkit handles calculator inputs, basic hosting data, and potential future advertising cookies." eyebrow="Legal"><p><em>Last updated: September 3, 2026.</em></p><h2>Calculator data</h2><p>Calculator inputs are processed in your browser. This site currently provides no account system or database and does not intentionally transmit calculator values to a site application server.</p><h2>Hosting logs</h2><p>The hosting provider may process routine request information such as IP address, browser type, requested URL, timestamp, and security events to deliver and protect the site. Retention and location depend on the selected Hostinger configuration.</p><h2>Cookies and advertising</h2><p>No advertising network is currently enabled, and the reserved advertisement spaces do not load third-party code. If Google advertising is added later, Google and its partners may use cookies or similar technologies for ad delivery and measurement. This policy will be updated before activation, and an appropriate consent-management platform may be required depending on visitor location.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can restrict cookies through browser settings. Future analytics or advertising controls will be documented here when actually enabled. Privacy questions may be sent through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p></Article>
